#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# fractional_part

#% text
# `fractional_part(x)` gives `x - integer_part(x)`, with the sign of `x`.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# Exact for exact numbers and closed numeric terms; machine numbers give machine numbers.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
fractional_part(7/3)
#% output
#= 1/3

#% cell
fractional_part(-2.4)
#% output
#= -0.3999999999999999

#% cell
fractional_part(pi)
#% output
#= -3 + pi

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `integer_part`, `floor`, `mod`
